    {
      "id": 487297,
      "username": "Jordi7-7",
      "name": "Jordi7 7",
      "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:05:17.795Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks bro,</p>\n<p>I just pulled the latest version from the <strong>develop</strong> branch, and I’ve encountered an issue in the POS. When I try to open the <strong>variant selector</strong>, instead of showing the selector, it directly opens a <strong>Warehouse Availability</strong> screen.</p>\n<p>I’ve attached an image of what appears now.</p>\n<p>This behavior seems to occur because the item shown is actually the <strong>template item</strong> in the POS. Since the template item itself has no stock (stock = 0), the system displays the warehouse availability screen instead of the variant selector.</p>\n<p>This is currently blocking me from opening the variant selector, so I believe this is the problem.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/4/a40e61e0cd8dd69d1795d83dfebc473481096ef4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a40e61e0cd8dd69d1795d83dfebc473481096ef4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a40e61e0cd8dd69d1795d83dfebc473481096ef4_2_690x440.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"npj7o4VQq0iWc88Kx6liV0rj628\" width=\"690\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/4/a40e61e0cd8dd69d1795d83dfebc473481096ef4_2_690x440.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/4/a40e61e0cd8dd69d1795d83dfebc473481096ef4.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/4/a40e61e0cd8dd69d1795d83dfebc473481096ef4.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E3E4E4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">820×523 127 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=